[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1265.11, "timestamp": "00:21:05", "text": "在黑暗中，我把东西放好，然后亲吻我的位置。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1267.029, "timestamp": "00:21:07", "text": "参议员拒绝帮助我。他们告诉我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1270.99, "timestamp": "00:21:10", "text": "如果没有地方可去，那就只能继续工作了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1273.99, "timestamp": "00:21:13", "text": "这里。你忘记了你爱过的人的数量。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1277.99, "timestamp": "00:21:17", "text": "并举起。哦，我当时还是个孩子。一辆车。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1280.35, "timestamp": "00:21:20", "text": "有很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1285.789, "timestamp": "00:21:25", "text": "小猫咪之类的。呃，有很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1289.31, "timestamp": "00:21:29", "text": "他养的小猫"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1309.23, "timestamp": "00:21:49", "text": "不。我当时在想什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1312.3, "timestamp": "00:21:52", "text": "怎么说？不，嘘。"}]